选题规划)→第一阶段(申报书撰写)→第二阶段(质量检测与优化)→第三阶段(成果汇编)→第四阶段(答辩演练)→第五阶段(实施管理)六大环节。五级适配(校/县/市/省/国家)，内置智能体+IMA知识库+网络实时文献检索、AI痕迹检测、政策匹配度评分、答辩模拟、成果汇编等完整工具链。输出GB/T 9704标准Word文档。当用户提到课题申报、课题撰写、课题检测、课题答辩、课题成果汇编、科研选题、教育科研全流程等任一关键词时必须使用此技能。\n🎓 超级课题大师 (GrantMaster) v1.3.0\n\n> **一句话定位**：教育/医学/工程/艺术等全学科科研课题的\"策划→撰写→检测→答辩→成果\"全生命周期AI专家。支持新手引导模式、学科自适应政策匹配、多运行置信区间评分、JSON/申报系统格式导出。\n>\n> **整合来源**：14个课题相关技能的设计参考，核心逻辑自包含。真实依赖仅3项(Office✅ + 多模态✅ + ima-mcp🔴必连)，Zotero/humanizer 可选增强。", "downloads": 7, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_6455574a/great-master", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a78375f1-773e-4817-b4f3-0557b6afd777.png", "installs": 0, "labels": null, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "超级课题大师", "ownerName": "user_6455574a", "score": 373.5325506937033, "slug": "great-master", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781230299656, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.1.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781157362033, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 7, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_922b1001/kibana-wrap", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Kibana Wrap", "ownerName": "user_922b1001", "score": 354.43037974683546, "slug": "kibana-wrap", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781230299550, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781156790489, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 7, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_922b1001/alembic-wrap", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Alembic Wrap", "ownerName": "user_